{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "woman-in-the-dunes",
  "chunk_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-chunk-0549",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "愤怒和屈辱，变成一根铁芯，从内侧硬顶住男人。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Anger and humiliation turned into an iron core, bracing the man rigidly from within.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "手指深深抠进发黏的手掌，又叫了起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "His fingers dug deep into his sticky palms, and he started shouting again.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“还不明白吗！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Do you still not understand?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "嘴上说了不明白吧，我不是做了叫你们看嘛！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I told you in words that you did not understand, so did I not show you?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我不是说过女人还捆着吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Did I not tell you the woman is still tied up?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "……现在不马上把我拉上去，或者放根绳梯下来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If you do not pull me up right now, or lower a rope ladder,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "不然那女人可就一直被捆着哟！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "then that woman is going to stay tied up forever!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "……没人会去清沙了……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No one will go clear away the sand anymore.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "好好想想吧……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Think it over carefully.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "这里被沙子埋掉的话，为难的还不是你们吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If this place gets buried in sand, will you not be the ones in trouble?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "……沙子越过这儿，可就要开始慢慢侵入村子喽！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Once the sand gets past here, it will start creeping into the village!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "……怎么啦？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What is wrong?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00549",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "……为什么不回答！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Why will you not answer?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
